{"id":146277197,"slug":"on-deprescribing","title":"On Deprescribing","subtitle":"A podcast appearance by Owen Scott Muir, M.D., DFAACAP ","post_date":"2024-07-05T12:06:01.214Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/on-deprescribing","wordcount":105,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:52:28.786Z","body_sha256":"05db3d06f939b5581868af7f4375fd76fe46c762057d5fd7ddeb8363401ad63c","text_words":176,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>A while back, I had the pleasure of joining <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Shawn Gill&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:135179107,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/554da1ad-932c-43f6-b276-8ac9f49575c2_1006x1008.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;3b762277-e215-45f3-b471-259db5a0559d&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>, a pharmacist, for a recording of his podcast.  It’s out for your listening pleasure.  We discuss the de-prescribing of psychiatric medications, the role of <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/tms-is-better-than-drugs?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">non-invasive brain stimulation</a>, and the data that guides the care we provide.   As a disclosure, I’m proud to be an advisor to <a href=\"https://www.outro.com\">Outro Health</a>—a company dedicated to bringing the de-prescribing of oral medicines to scale.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HBTO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f6c2dac-b4c1-4ca4-a2bb-e73927a3626d_4284x3622.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com