ing Alternatives To Psychiatric Medicines | Dr. Owen Scott Muir. MD.\n\nWelcome to the third episode of Deprescribe with Shawn. Our guest today is Dr.Owen Scott Muir, M.D. In this episode, Owen and Shawn discuss: The limitations of psychiatric medicines and the need for evidence and payment models for non-pharmacological interventions…\n\nListen now\n\n2 years ago · 1 like · Shawn Gill"}